      <div class="container-1280">
        <div class="title-left-side-wrapper expertise equipes">
          <div class="border-gradient-div expertise"></div>
          <h2 class="title30px no-marg">Frequently asked questions:&nbsp;</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions">
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003207-04d15a2d" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003207" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">1. How can I equip my restaurant with Innovorder?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">At Innovorder, we do everything we can to make your experience as smooth as possible.<br><br>But the easiest way is to make an appointment with an expert advisor, visit our showroom and discover all our solutions. Together, we'll define the solution best suited to your needs. And if you can't make it to the showroom, a phone call is all it takes to lay the foundations for our future collaboration.<br><br>Then we'll make an appointment to install our solutions on site, train you and make sure you're ready to get your business off the ground!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211-04d15a2d" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">2.  Is Innovorder right for my restaurant?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Whatever the size of your establishment or structure, Innovorder is designed for both fast food and commercial catering (independent, franchise, food court, dark kitchen, etc.) and institutional catering (SRC, self-managed).<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b-04d15a2d" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">3. What's included in the price?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No unpleasant surprises!<br><br>Our turnkey solution includes: hardware, license, installation, maintenance, unlimited updates and regular follow-up by a dedicated account manager.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a-04d15a2d" data-w-id="9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">4. Is Innovorder synchronized with my favorite applications?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder interfaces with the most popular restaurant applications: Uber Eats, Splio, Stripe, Combo, Stuart, etc. And to provide you with an even richer offering, we're continually expanding our catalog of integrations.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-b06ef6bd-7ff9-02b2-0cdb-4838e2c70865-04d15a2d" data-w-id="b06ef6bd-7ff9-02b2-0cdb-4838e2c70865" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">5. How do I switch from JES to Innovorder?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our teams will assess your current system (access cards, guest accounts, pricing, vending machines, HR interfaces) to develop a customized migration plan. The installation is scheduled outside of service hours so as not to disrupt your guests.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-a433f2cd-16e5-a545-c6f0-48e3f2fd91bd-04d15a2d" data-w-id="a433f2cd-16e5-a545-c6f0-48e3f2fd91bd" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">6. Does Innovorder work if there is an Internet outage?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes: In the event of an outage, your registers will continue to process payments, and the data will sync automatically as soon as the connection is restored.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
